                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13f19a77-cf81-3e1b-bf9f-f66afda869d3",
                        "entry_id": "bde79aee-5385-36dc-b4ea-25ffce1f6b68",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. расходиться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6cd41178-e1b1-3fa5-8654-f7a74fc2ef50",
                        "entry_id": "bde79aee-5385-36dc-b4ea-25ffce1f6b68",
                        "glosses": [
                            "результат такого действия; несовпадение, противоречие в чём-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d401de36-f26a-48fd-a963-62e7ba999000",
                                "sense_id": "6cd41178-e1b1-3fa5-8654-f7a74fc2ef50",
                                "text": "Ему не давало покоя расхождение между теми правилами, которые прививаются в детском саду, и тем, что он видит в жизни."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "262a4658-312b-41d2-952a-88808b7f26f4",
                                "sense_id": "6cd41178-e1b1-3fa5-8654-f7a74fc2ef50",
                                "text": "Расхождение масс, того значения, которое ей давал гравилокатор, и вычисленной по объему тела, предполагаемой плотности его вещества, было минимальным, на грани погрешности."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cc21b2a6-874d-3899-9b1e-bac7a6ccce4c",
                        "entry_id": "bde79aee-5385-36dc-b4ea-25ffce1f6b68",
                        "glosses": [
                            "несогласие с кем-либо или с чем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f8f88168-8c80-4308-b62f-216d9ca8467d",
                        "source_entry_id": "bde79aee-5385-36dc-b4ea-25ffce1f6b68",
                        "target_lang_word": "discrepancy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "discrepancy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1409e323-deb2-3ba4-b1f9-4cf5f305305e",
                                        "entry_id": "a7506862-6b7b-3f45-8820-340a40051c0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inconsistency between facts or sentiments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9574d201-1faf-46e8-a4b9-838ed94a919c",
                                                "sense_id": "1409e323-deb2-3ba4-b1f9-4cf5f305305e",
                                                "text": "They found a discrepancy between the first set of test results and the second, and they're still trying to figure out why."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eda1e472-b162-4779-9e31-cebb8b797295",
                                                "sense_id": "1409e323-deb2-3ba4-b1f9-4cf5f305305e",
                                                "text": "Still, there is pilferage, mysterious discrepancies eating into the percentages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16bd5542-cc65-47bf-afe7-71fe4f2e24ab",
                                                "sense_id": "1409e323-deb2-3ba4-b1f9-4cf5f305305e",
                                                "text": "WikiLeaks did not cause these uprisings but it certainly informed them. The dispatches revealed details of corruption and kleptocracy that many Tunisians suspected, […]. They also exposed the blatant discrepancy between the west's professed values and actual foreign policies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a78740d2-c679-37d3-ad10-f750ff683de6",
                                        "entry_id": "a7506862-6b7b-3f45-8820-340a40051c0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or quality of being discrepant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
